                                                "sense_id": "c5c72ad2-bdff-326c-86cf-50018cbb0ee9",
                                                "text": "This was the healing ritual for the King's Evil, the name given to scrofula or struma, the tubercular inflammation of the lymph glands of the neck."
                                            }
